│                        │ Client secret   {{billing_secret}}                                                        │
│                        │ Username        {{api_user}}                                                              │
│                        │ Password        hunter2                                                    ⚠ plain text   │
│                        │ Scopes          invoices:read                                                             │
│                                                                                                                    │
│ The [oauth.<name>] key a request's OAuth auth names; no spaces.                                                    │
│                                                                                                                    │
